"running-the-templated-kernel)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/optimizing-with-composable-kernel.md:23
msgid "Template parameter definition"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/optimizing-with-composable-kernel.md:25
msgid ""
"The template parameters of the instance are grouped into four parameter "
"types:"
msgstr ""

