#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:94
msgid ""
"Use AITER quantization operators + GEMM for linear layers (defaults to "
"``1`` when AITER is on). Accelerates matrix multiplications in all "
"transformer layers. **Recommended to keep enabled**."
