#, python-format
msgid ""
"**2.7–4.4x TPS** over legacy ``ROCM_ATTN``. Set "
"``VLLM_ROCM_SHUFFLE_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=1`` for **15–20% decode improvement**"
" at high concurrency. Low TTFT: ``--max-num-batched-tokens`` ≤ 8k–16k. "
"High throughput: ≥ 32k with ``cudagraph_mode=FULL``."
