#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:180
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**1.2–1.5x higher TPS** over ``TRITON_MLA``. Supports uniform-batch CUDA "
"graphs and MTP. On MI300X/MI325X (gfx942), ``ROCM_AITER_TRITON_MLA`` may "
"show 2–3% higher TPS. On MI355X (gfx950), ``ROCM_AITER_MLA`` is preferred"
" (uses AITER assembly MHA for prefill)."
