msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:633
msgid "Configure --max-num-batched-tokens"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:635
msgid "**Chunked prefill is enabled by default** in vLLM V1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:637
msgid "Lower values improve **ITL** (less prefill interrupting decode)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:638
msgid "Higher values improve **TTFT** (more prefill per batch)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:640
msgid ""
"Defaults: **8192** for online serving, **16384** for offline. However, "
"optimal values vary significantly by model size. Smaller models can "
"efficiently handle larger batch sizes. Setting it near ``--max-model-"
"len`` mimics V0 behavior and often maximizes throughput."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:642
msgid "**Guidance:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:644
msgid "**Interactive (low TTFT)**: keep MBT ≤ **8k–16k**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:645
msgid "**Streaming (low ITL)**: MBT **16k–32k**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:646
msgid ""
"**Offline max throughput**: MBT **≥32k** (diminishing TPS returns beyond "
"~32k)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:648
msgid ""
"**Pattern:** Smaller/more efficient models benefit from larger batch "
"sizes. MoE models with expert parallelism can handle very large batches "
"efficiently."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:650
msgid "**Rule of thumb**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:652
msgid "Push MBT **up** to trade TTFT↑ for ITL↓ and slightly higher TPS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:653
msgid "Pull MBT **down** to trade ITL↑ for TTFT↓ (interactive UX)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:656
msgid "Async scheduling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:658
msgid ""
"``--async-scheduling`` (replaces deprecated ``num_scheduler_steps``) can "
"improve throughput/ITL by trading off TTFT. Prefer **off** for latency-"
"sensitive serving; **on** for offline batch throughput."
msgstr ""

