"directly with vLLM:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:885
msgid "**Important Notes:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:887
msgid ""
"**ROCm requirement:** Set ``VLLM_USE_TRITON_AWQ=1`` to enable Triton-"
"based AWQ kernels on ROCm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:888
msgid ""
"**dtype parameter:** AWQ requires ``--dtype auto`` or ``--dtype "
"float16``. The ``--dtype`` flag controls the **activation dtype** "
"(``FP16``/``BF16`` for computations), not the weight dtype. AWQ weights "
"remain as INT4 (4-bit integers) as specified in the model's quantization "
"config, but are dequantized to ``FP16``/``BF16`` during matrix "
"multiplication operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:892
msgid ""
"**Group size:** 128 is recommended for optimal performance/accuracy "
"balance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/rocm-for-ai/inference-optimization/vllm-optimization.rst:893
msgid ""
"**Model compatibility:** AWQ is primarily tested on Llama, Mistral, and "
"Qwen model families"
msgstr ""

