"Use ``--kv-cache-dtype fp8`` to enable ``FP8`` KV-cache quantization. For"
" best accuracy, use calibrated scaling factors generated via `LLM "
"Compressor <https://github.com/vllm-project/llm-compressor>`_. Without "
"calibration, scales are calculated dynamically (``--calculate-kv-"
"scales``) with minimal accuracy impact."
