":doc:`RCCL <rccl:index>` is a stand-alone library of standard collective "
"communication routines for GPUs, implementing all-reduce, all-gather, "
"reduce, broadcast, reduce-scatter, gather, scatter, and all-to-all. RCCL "
"supports an arbitrary number of GPUs installed in a single node or "
"multiple nodes and can be used in either single- or multi-process (such "
"as MPI) applications."
msgstr ""

