msgid ""
"`SGLANG_MORI_NUM_MAX_DISPATCH_TOKENS_PER_RANK` — SGLang asserts this "
"value is ≥ `chunked_prefill_size / dp_size`. For the default DeepSeek-R1 "
"recipe (262144 / 8 = 32768), `set_env_vars.sh`'s shipped value of 16384 "
"triggers an `AssertionError` on the prefill node only (decode is exempt)."
" Raising this to 32768 fixes the crash."
