msgid ""
"`MORI_SHMEM_HEAP_SIZE` — Raising the dispatch budget to 32768 tokens "
"exceeds MoRI's default 4 GB static heap and causes an out-of-memory error"
" at first inference. Set this to `16G` (MoRI's own inter-node test "
"default)."
