msgid ""
"The ROCm Megatron-LM framework is a specialized fork of the robust "
"Megatron-LM, designed to enable efficient training of large-scale "
"language models on AMD GPUs. By leveraging AMD Instinct™ MI300X GPUs, AMD"
" Megatron-LM delivers enhanced scalability, performance, and resource "
"utilization for AI workloads. It is purpose-built to :ref:`support models"
" <amd-megatron-lm-model-support-24-12>` like Meta's Llama 2, Llama 3, and"
" Llama 3.1, enabling developers to train next-generation AI models with "
"greater efficiency. See the GitHub repository at "
"`<https://github.com/ROCm/Megatron-LM>`__."
msgstr ""

